======================================================================


Even with fix: Still wrong, this is lexicographical sorting, not numerical sorting. The correct order should be frame0.jpg, frame1.jpg, frame2.jpg, ..., frame32.jpg. The glob.glob() function does not guarantee any specific order of the files it returns, which is why we need to sort the list of file paths to ensure they are in the correct temporal order for processing by the LSTM model.


