NOTE: these earlier runs were testing the test code and not the VideoDataset class itself. The VideoDataset class was already using the correct sorting method with the regex to extract the frame numbers and sort them numerically. The test code was not correctly reflecting that, which is why it showed that the frames were out of order. The VideoDataset class should be fine as long as it uses the correct sorting method as shown in the final run.

